# Paw_P1_Open - P1's open paw holding the waiting ball, palm towards the viewer: white sock, pink toe beans and pad,
# over the orange-tabby cuff that continues the Arm_P1 sleeve (rows 30+, paw x = sleeve x + 6).
# Toes point up the screen (the arm reaches up from the bottom); palm centre (18, 20) = pivot.
# One silhouette with four round toe lobes (notches between them, not four outlined circles); the white fur ends in
# uneven tufts over the orange, their line in the deep fur tone (the shadow the tufts cast).
size 36 40
key
  K #3a1a0a  ink (outer line)
  X #8f4c0d  deep fur: lit-side outline, core shadow, stripes, the shadow under the white tufts
  H #ee8a5e  lit fur
  F #d67244  fur base  line=X
  S #bb612a  fur shadow, reflected light
  L #f4f6fb  paw highlight
  W #e3e8f2  paw base  line=w
  w #babdc9  paw shadow
  P #e88aa6  bean
  p #bb698e  bean shade
