seeds
  W 18 20
  F 18 37
ops
  # the white paw: form shadow as a crescent on the bottom-right
  band W w 1 1 2
  # the cuff: the sleeve's columns (highlight, shadow, core, reflected light)
  poly F H 8 28 11 28 11 39 8 39
  poly F S 21 28 28 28 28 39 21 39
  poly F X 25 28 27 28 27 39 25 39
# the sleeve's bold tabby ring, carried onto the cuff (sleeve rows 3-6, x + 6)
